Please provide the patent publication number, link, or text—especially the generic formula and preparation examples. I need the source to accurately summarize:

- the invention and pesticidal activity;
- every variable, substituent, and proviso in the generic formula;
- the active-ingredient composition, including carriers/adjuvants and concentration ranges; and
- at least one disclosed method for preparing the compounds.

Without the underlying document, I cannot reliably identify or define the formula’s variables.
